<item>
  <title>我的第一篇数学笔记</title>
  <link>https://your-website-url.example.com/posts/first-math/</link>
  <description><![CDATA[ 





<p>这是我在个人网站上发布的第一篇数学笔记。</p>
<section id="题目" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="题目">题目</h2>
<p>已知函数 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?f(x)=x%5E2">，求它在 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?x=1"> 处的切线方程。</p>
</section>
<section id="解答" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="解答">解答</h2>
<p>对函数求导，得到：</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0Af'(x)=2x.%0A"></p>
<p>因此，切线斜率为 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?f'(1)=2">，切点为 <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?(1,1)">。</p>
<p>由点斜式，切线方程为：</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0Ay-1=2(x-1),%0A"></p>
<p>即：</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0A%5Cboxed%7By=2x-1%7D.%0A"></p>


</section>

 ]]></description>
